    "text": "BY virtue of the powers vested in me by Section 2A of the Value Added Tax Act, No. 14 of 2002, as amended by Act, No.06 of 2005, I, Mangala Samaraweera, Minister of Finance and Mass Media, do by this Order declare that the Value AddedTax shall be charged on import or supply of imported goods specified under H. S. Code and description in Column I and IIof the Schedule hereto, at the rate specified in the corresponding entry in Column III, of such Schedule.",
